 false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "34998895096423800"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "941082507652175"}]}, "change_log": "- New Feature: Read discovered Terminal Entries & Relic Journals from the Stats Hub found in basecamp\n- Fixed a crash when trying to use R-011 in Terminal late in the game and when your language progress is at a high level\n- Tweaked bomb slot placement\n- General Optimisations", "created_date": 1775473682, "id": "34754700564176589", "version": "1.0.9", "version_code": 168, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25060508500262559", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "34998895096423800"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "941082507652175"}]}, "change_log": "Upgraded map system now includes where Portals, Terminals or Relics (worker droids) were discovered", "created_date": 1775297449, "id": "34714224208224225", "version": "1.0.8", "version_code": 167, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}